Hi,

Here is the python-linstor and linstor-client release, bringing small
features for the upcoming linstor-server 1.24.0 release

## linstor-client
### Added

- Backup queue list command

### Changed

- `linstor -v` now shows that it is the client version

### Fixed

- Fix aux argument list handling for replicas-on-same and similar

https://pkg.linbit.com//downloads/linstor/linstor-client-1.19.0.tar.gz

## python-linstor
### Added

- Added backup queue list methods

https://pkg.linbit.com//downloads/linstor/python-linstor-1.19.0.tar.gz

Linstor PPA:
https://launchpad.net/~linbit/+archive/ubuntu/linbit-drbd9-stack

Best regards,
Rene

